    dialogueText: My old computer! Dad wanted the password.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Akila
    dialogueText: Oh no... I don't remember my login credentials. I always was a
      forgetful person.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Akila
    dialogueText: 'There has to be clues to my password and username around here. '
